(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[10] = {"n": 10, "title": "Nominative Noun Roles", "ar": "المَرْفُوعَاتُ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> alone does not tell you the role of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>. Establish its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and its relationship to the rest of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span>. This module brings together <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل، نائب الفاعل، المبتدأ، الخبر</span></b> and four further <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعات</span> already encountered with particular <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوامل</span>.</p><p>Recall <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلوم، مجهول، فعل تام، فعل ناقص، اسم فاعل، اسم مفعول، مصدر، معرفة، نكرة، مضاف إليه، شبه جملة، قرينة</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسند إليه</span></b> is what something is stated about; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسند</span></b> is what is stated about it. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span></b> supplies understood wording; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف جائز</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف واجب</span></b> are different judgements.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s2\">What can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>?</h2><p>Some <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء، أفعال</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>; others are not. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أشباه الجمل</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول. حروف</span> are not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>, although a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> may itself be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>. Thus <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها وخبرها</span> but has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل إعرابي</span> of its own.</p><p>An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم صريح</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> expressed directly: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصَّوْمُ نَافِعٌ</span></b>. An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span></b> may consist of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مصدري</span> with its following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَنْ تَصُومُوا خَيْرٌ لَكُمْ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن تصوموا</span> has the place of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صومكم</span>. An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم معمول بالأصالة</span></b> receives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> directly, rather than through following another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع، نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>; here we study <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المرفوعات الثمانية</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَ خالدٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتِحَ البابُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حاضرٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حاضرٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الأفعال الناقصة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ حاضرًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الحروف المشبهة بليس</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خالدٌ غائبًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر الحروف المشبهة بالفعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا حاضرٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا لنفي الجنس</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ في البيتِ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع لفظًا</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> rather than a changing ending; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> may occupy a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> role while its internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا</span>.</p><p>Each question or table row has one correct choice and a worked solution. When a construction permits more than one analysis, follow the account named in the question.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}, {"id": "L0-s2", "title": "What can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>?"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "Recognising the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">The relationship comes first</h2><p>The <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></b> is what a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل تام معلوم</span></b> is attributed to, or what receives that relationship from an expression with the meaning of such a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>. It need not deliberately perform an action: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَسَا القَلْبُ</span></b>, “the heart became hard,” has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القلبُ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَضَرَ زَيْدٌ. أَحَاضِرٌ زَيْدٌ؟</span></b> <span class=\"gl\">Zayd arrived. Is Zayd present?</span></div><p>In the first, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيدٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span>. In the second, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>, supported by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>, and raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيدٌ</span> as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. Recall the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل اسم الفاعل</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> does not govern merely because it resembles a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> in meaning.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and the visible wording</h2><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> normally shows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>, but the surface wording may show <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Expression</th><th>Relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاءَ مِنْ بَشِيرٍ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من زائدة؛ بشير مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا على الفاعلية</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَفَى باللهِ وَكِيلًا</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء زائدة؛ الله مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا على الفاعلية</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذِكْرُكُمْ آباءَكُمْ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكر مصدر مضاف إلى فاعله؛ كم مضاف إليه، وهو فاعل المصدر في المعنى</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span></b> does not mean meaningless: these <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف</span> have a grammatical description and may reinforce meaning. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة المصدر</span>, distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ الإضافة</span> from the underlying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلية</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> relationship can be described as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع محلّي</span> in this account; the detailed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> analysis still identifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>. Do not give the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> two different visible endings.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاءَ مِنْ بَشِيرٍ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">No bearer of good news came.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي لا محل له من الإعراب</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض معلوم مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر زائد</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشير</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور لفظًا بمن، مرفوع محلًّا</span>. There is no separate hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> replacing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشير</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "The relationship comes first"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and the visible wording"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the expression to the stated relationship.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القلبُ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> even though no deliberate action is meant. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيدٌ</span></b> is raised by the supported <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الفاعل حاضر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها وخبرها</span> but is itself a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له من الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسا القلبُ: القلب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل لفعل مجهول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لفعل تام معلوم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحاضرٌ زيدٌ؟ زيد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لحاضر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لحاضر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لاسم فاعل عامل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا حاضرٌ: إنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل غير معمول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء من بشيرٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض معلوم مبني على الفتح؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر زائد؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشيرٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور لفظًا بمن مرفوع محلًّا</span>. The visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> does not erase the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> relationship.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض معلوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر زائد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشير</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما منصوب بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the correct analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذِكْرُكم آباءَكم</span></b>. Focus on the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكر</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر أضيف إلى فاعله</span>: the first <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span> and supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> meaning. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آباءَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به للمصدر منصوب، وهو مضاف؛</span> the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and the underlying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلية</span> distinct.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم مضاف إليه للمصدر، وهو فاعله في المعنى</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم مفعول به للمصدر، وآباء فاعله</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم حرف جر زائد، وآباء مبتدأ</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the ending and role in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتد الحر. حضر الضيف</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتدّ</span> = became intense.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشتدَّ الحرُّ. حضرَ الضيفُ</span>.</b> Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لفعل تام معلوم</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span>. The definition concerns what the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is attributed to, not whether the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> represents a deliberate action.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحرَّ: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحرُّ: فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحرِّ: مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفَ: خبر كان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفِ: مجرور بحضر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيفُ: فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصومُ نافعٌ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن تصوموا خيرٌ لكم</span></b>. What occupies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> role?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصومُ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم صريح مبتدأ مرفوع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن تصوموا</span></b> is understood as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صومكم</span>: the complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span> occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع مبتدأ. أن</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرفًا مصدريًّا ناصبًا</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصوموا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بحذف النون، والواو فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "1R|Review", "opts": ["Both expressions are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف غير معمول</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span> alone is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مرفوع؛ تصوموا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصوم اسم صريح؛ أن تصوموا اسم مؤوّل في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل ما نُسب إليه الفعل التام المعلوم أو ما بمعناه</span>.</b> Which conclusion follows?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أو ما بمعناه</span></b> includes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل اسم</span> with the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> meaning, such as a supported <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>. Still establish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> and the actual relationship.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> meeting its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل شروط</span> can raise a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.", "Only a written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> can ever raise a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> after a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> regardless of its relationship."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "Ordering the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به</span>", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">Start from the ordinary order</h2><p>The ordinary order places <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زَارَ خَالِدٌ سَعِيدًا</span></b>. With clear relationships, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زَارَ سَعِيدًا خَالِدٌ</span></b> is also possible. Track the endings before relying on position.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span> first</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زُرْتُ خَالِدًا</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل</span>; do not detach it merely to move it after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زارَ مُوسَى عِيسَى</span></b></td><td>Both endings are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة</span> and no distinguishing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span> is supplied; the first is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زارَتْ هذِهِ تِلْكَ</span></b></td><td>The wording does not distinguish the two roles, so retain the ordinary order</td></tr></tbody></table><p>An independent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span> can remove the ambiguity: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكَلَ الكُمَّثْرَى مُوسَى</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة معنوية</span>: Musa ate the pears. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَصَرَتْ مُوسَى سَلْمَى</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة لفظية: تاء التأنيث</span> identifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلمى</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span>. The same need to avoid ambiguity applies when ordering <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كان وأخواتها</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\">When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به</span> must come first</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Expression</th><th>Why <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم المفعول به</span> is required here</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَ خَالِدًا مُعَلِّمُهُ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span> contains a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به</span>; keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> before that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَهُ المُعَلِّمُ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل</span>; do not detach it merely to put <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span> first</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَيَّ كِتَابٍ قَرَأْتَ؟</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدر الكلام</span>; here it precedes even the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>These are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> on the stated ordinary constructions, not a ban on every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> appearing before any later <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> in Arabic.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمَ خَالِدًا مُعَلِّمُهُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid's teacher honoured him.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مؤخّر مرفوع بالضمة، وهو مضاف</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه، يعود إلى خالد</span>.</li></ul><p>If a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> precedes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>, use the usual analysis <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حضرَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مبتدأ؛ حضر فعل وفاعله ضمير مستتر تقديره هو؛ الجملة في محل رفع خبر</span>. Another account allows the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> to be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. Our questions specify the usual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> analysis when this distinction matters.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "Start from the ordinary order"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به</span> must come first"}, {"id": "L2-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the reason for the required order in each stated construction.", "sol": "<p>Without a distinguishing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موسى</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيسى</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم خالدًا معلّمُه</span></b> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> refers back to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>, requiring this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم المفعول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام له صدر الكلام؛ كتابٍ مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زار موسى عيسى، بلا قرينة أخرى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام له صدر الكلام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيسى فاعل لأنّه آخر اسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خوف اللبس؛ موسى فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم خالدًا معلّمُه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في الفاعل يعود إلى المفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يجوز تأخير أي فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مبتدأ مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ قرأتَ؟</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ مفعول به له صدر الكلام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ فاعل مؤخّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب خبر مقدّم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم خالدًا معلّمُه</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم منصوب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مؤخّر مرفوع ومضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه تعود إلى خالد</span>. The order keeps the referring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> after the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> supplying its reference.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مؤخّر مرفوع بالضمة، وهو مضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تنبيه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه يعود إلى خالد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read without relying on ordinary order. Identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موسى</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in the first because the meaning distinguishes Musa from the pears. In the second, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span></b> identifies <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلمى</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل؛ موسى مفعول به</span>. In the third, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامدٌ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; the expressed endings distinguish them.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكل الكمثرى موسى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موسى؛ قرينة معنوية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل محذوف وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكمثرى؛ لا قرينة للمعنى</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصرت موسى سلمى، والتاء تاء التأنيث</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلمى؛ قرينة لفظية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موسى؛ لأنّه أقرب إلى الفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء نفسها فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زار سعيدًا حامدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامد؛ الضمة والفتحة تميّزان الدورين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد؛ لأنّه قبل حامد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A learner changes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعدَهُ خالدٌ</span></b> to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعدَ خالدٌ إيّاهُ</span></b> solely to restore ordinary order. Which correction fits the rule taught here?", "sol": "<p>In the ordinary construction <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعده خالدٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل في محل نصب مفعول به</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد فاعل</span>. Do not replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاتصال</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الانفصال</span> merely to reverse their order. Compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل المتصل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعدتُ خالدًا</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعدَه خالدٌ: المفعول به</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل</span>, so it precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span> here.", "Change <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span> because a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> precedes it.", "The change is required because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span> must always come first."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ قرأَ</span></b> using the usual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> account.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وفاعله ضمير مستتر تقديره هو يعود إلى سعيد؛ الجملة في محل رفع خبر</span>. The question selects this account; it does not deny the alternative account allowing a preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "2R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد مبتدأ؛ قرأ وفاعله المستتر هو جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد اسم كان محذوفة وجوبًا؛ قرأ خبر منصوب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد مفعول به مقدّم؛ قرأ بلا فاعل</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب تقديم الفاعل عند خوف اللبس</span>.</b> In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زار موسى عيسى</span></b> with no other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>, which reading follows?", "sol": "<p>The endings are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة</span>, and the question excludes another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>. The required ordinary order therefore identifies <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موسى</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيسى</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> can be assigned a role.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موسى فاعل وعيسى مفعول به</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيسى فاعل وموسى مفعول به</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "Recognising the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">What changes with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجهول</span>?</h2><p>The <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span></b> is what a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل تام مجهول</span></b> is attributed to, or what receives that relationship from an expression with the same meaning, such as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل اسم مفعول</span>.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ الطَّالِبُ الرِّسَالَةَ. كُتِبَتِ الرِّسَالَةُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The student wrote the letter. The letter was written.</span></div><p>In the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة, الطالب</span> is not expressed; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>. Recall the simple <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span> pattern <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتِبَ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَكْتُبُ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُكْتَبُ</span></b>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتِبَتِ الرسالةُ, التاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> permits joining to the next word. It is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عامل</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَمَفْتُوحٌ البابُ؟</span></b> <span class=\"gl\">Is the door open?</span></div><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوحٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span> supported by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>. It raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>. Under the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكتفي بمرفوعه</span> analysis introduced next, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span> also <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بِخَالِدٍ</span></b>, “Khalid was brought,” analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بخالد</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع نائب فاعل</span>. Internally, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمًا مجرورًا</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> relationship does not change <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتِحَ البابُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The door was opened.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتح</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مجهول مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li></ul><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَتَحَ الحَارِسُ البابَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارس فاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب مفعول به</span>. Decide from the construction and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضبط الفعل</span>, not from the meaning of “door.”</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "What changes with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجهول</span>?"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عامل</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each highlighted relationship.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلوم</span> and raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارس</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتح</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجهول</span> and raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوح</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول عامل</span> supported by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> and raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span> in the selected account.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح الحارسُ البابَ: الحارس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتح البابُ: الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمفتوحٌ البابُ؟</span> under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكتفي بمرفوعه: الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل لاسم مفعول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لفعل ماض معلوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Use the account making <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة نائب الفاعل</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بخالدٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مجهول مبني على الفتح؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>. The whole <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بخالد</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع نائب فاعل</span> under the stated account. Its internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> remains unchanged.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جيء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض معلوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مجهول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نصب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منصوب بجيء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالباء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بخالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة بلا علاقة بالفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية في محل نصب حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete the change to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجهول</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ حامدٌ الخبرَ</span> ← ...</b>", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتِبَ الخبرُ</span></b> omits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامد</span> and makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخبر نائب فاعل مرفوعًا</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span> pattern is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتِبَ</span>. Changing only the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> ending without changing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضبط الفعل</span> does not produce the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجهول</span> construction.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ الخبرُ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتِبَ الخبرَ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتِبَ الخبرُ</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتِبتِ الرسالةُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مجهول؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث الساكنة في الأصل، حُرّكت بالكسر للوصل والتخلّص من التقاء الساكنين؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع</span>. Do not confuse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مجهول مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث، ليست فاعلًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به متصل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لفعل معلوم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الضيفُ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُكرم الضيفُ</span></b>. What stays the same and what changes?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلوم: الضيف فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُكرم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجهول: الضيف نائب فاعل</span>. Both roles have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>; neither the visible ending alone nor a loose meaning-based label distinguishes them.</p>", "group": "3R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيف</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> in the second because its meaning receives an action.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيف فاعل</span> in both because both end in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيف مرفوع</span> in both<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ فاعل</span> in the first and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span> in the second."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يكون نائب الفاعل شبه جملة</span>.</b> What does this permit in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِيءَ بكتابٍ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>The statement concerns the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of the whole <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بكتاب</span></b>. Its internal construction remains <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء حرف جر</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ اسم مجرور</span></b>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> becomes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بكتاب في محل رفع نائب فاعل، وكتاب مجرور بالباء</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> must become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "Recognising two patterns of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">The familiar pattern</h2><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span></b> may be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرّد عن عامل لفظي، مسند إليه</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ مُعَلِّمٌ</span></b>. There is no governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظ</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان</span> assigning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> its role. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرّد</span></b> does not mean that no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> can ever precede it.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ المكتفي بمرفوعه</span></h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عامل</span> following <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي أو استفهام</span></b> can raise an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> and be complete with that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>, without a separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>:</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَقَائِمٌ خَالِدٌ؟ ما حَاضِرٌ أَخَوَاكَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Is Khalid standing? Your two brothers are not present.</span></div><p>Use the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكتفي بمرفوعه</span></b> account: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم / حاضر مبتدأ، وخالد / أخواك فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span> similarly has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَمَفْتُوحٌ البابُ؟</span></b></p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span></b> means that the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> fulfils the required completion. It does not give the same word a second role as an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أراغبٌ أنت؟</span></b>, the separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير أنت</span> can fulfil this expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> role. Another valid account makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت مبتدأ مؤخرًا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راغب خبرًا مقدّمًا</span>; retain the analysis requested.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الابتداء</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَخَالِدٌ صَادِقٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid certainly is truthful.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَـ</span></b> adds <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> and leaves <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مبتدأ مرفوعًا</span>. It differs from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِـ</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِخَالِدٍ كتابٌ</span></b>, where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور. لام الابتداء</span> may also precede a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَصَادِقٌ أَنْتَ</span></b>.</p><p>You may meet the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> described with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل جامد</span>, or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> preceded by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَأَقُولُ الحقَّ، لَبِئْسَ الكذبُ، لَقَدْ حَضَرَ خالدٌ</span></b>. An alternative explanation in such settings relates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم محذوف</span>. Do not conclude from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَ</span> alone that the following word must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَقَائِمٌ خَالِدٌ؟</span></b> <span class=\"gl\">Use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكتفي بمرفوعه</span> account.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهمزة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استفهام</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة، وهو اسم فاعل عامل اعتمد على الاستفهام</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لقائم مرفوع بالضمة، سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "The familiar pattern"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ المكتفي بمرفوعه</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الابتداء</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the relationships. For the last two rows, use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكتفي بمرفوعه</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد معلّم</span></b> has an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقائم خالد؟</span></b>, the selected analysis makes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاملًا لاسم بعده</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>. It supplies completion without being an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> in that same account.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ معلّمٌ: خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ له خبر مستقل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لمعلّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقائمٌ خالدٌ؟ قائم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ عامل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقائمٌ خالدٌ؟ خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر قائم في التحليل المختار</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> constructions.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَـ</span></b> adds <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> without governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوعًا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِـ</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لخالدٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور؛ لخالد خبر مقدّم</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب مبتدأ مؤخّر. مجرّد عن عامل لفظي</span> does not ban every preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَخالدٌ صادقٌ: اللام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر الجازمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الابتداء والتوكيد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِخالدٍ كتابٌ: خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور باللام</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَخالدٌ صادقٌ: خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما حاضرٌ أخواك</span></b> using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكتفي بمرفوعه</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ واسم فاعل عامل اعتمد على النفي؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخوا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر، مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى، وحذفت النون للإضافة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. No separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> is needed.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول هنا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع، اسم فاعل اعتمد على النفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما منصوب في هذا الضبط</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر، مرفوع بالألف، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ثان منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أراغبٌ أنت؟</span></b>, which statement correctly handles the two accounts taught?", "sol": "<p>In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكتفي</span> account, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راغب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ عامل</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>. In the other account, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راغب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم</span>. Each is a complete separate analysis; do not merge them.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span> may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلًا سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>, or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّرًا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راغب خبرًا مقدّمًا</span>.", "Both accounts make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span> simultaneously <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلًا ومبتدأ</span> in one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا به</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راغب</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمفتوحٌ البابُ؟</span></b> using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكتفي بمرفوعه</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوح</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span>, so its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span></b>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. Under the selected account, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوح مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب نائب فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>.</p>", "group": "4R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوح مبتدأ عامل؛ الباب نائب فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوح مبتدأ؛ الباب فاعل لاسم فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوح فعل ماض؛ الباب مفعول به</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ المكتفي بمرفوعه اسم عامل يرفع اسمًا بعد نفي أو استفهام</span>.</b> What must be identified?", "sol": "<p>Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> and the relationship of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المكتفي بمرفوعه</span></b> means that this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> supplies the needed completion; it does not call for an additional invented <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عامل</span>, its supporting <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي أو استفهام</span>, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> completing it.", "A separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> after every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>, even when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span> is already complete.", "An omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> before every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عامل</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "Using a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\">The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> is useful meaning</h2><p>The ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> when it is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفيدة</span></b>: the construction or context makes the statement informative. Learn the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>, rather than replacing them with “a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> can never be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.”</p><table><thead><tr><th>What makes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مفيدة</span>?</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص بالإضافة لفظًا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبُ علمٍ حاضرٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص بالإضافة تقديرًا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلٌّ يعملُ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ أي كلُّ أحدٍ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص بالوصف لفظًا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبدٌ مؤمنٌ خيرٌ من مشركٍ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص بالوصف تقديرًا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طائفةٌ قد أهمّتْهم أنفسُهم</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ أي طائفةٌ منهم</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عموم</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما أحدٌ في البيتِ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أإلهٌ مع اللهِ؟</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأخيرها عن خبر شبه جملة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيتِ رجلٌ؛ لكلِّ أجلٍ كتابٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقوعها بعد إذا الفجائية</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجتُ فإذا رجلٌ قاعدٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلامٌ عليكم</span></b></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظًا</span></b> means expressed; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديرًا</span></b> means understood. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> can specify an expression without making it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة: طالب علم</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span></b> presents an unexpected scene; it is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span> used for a future <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فِي البَيْتِ رَجُلٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">There is a man in the house.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع خبر مقدّم، متعلّق بمحذوف تقديره كائن</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر مرفوع بالضمة</span>. The preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر شبه جملة</span> supplies a setting that makes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> informative.</li></ul><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجلُ في البيتِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span> is already <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مقدّم</span>. Identify the relationship even when position changes.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> is useful meaning"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مبتدأ</span> to the stated reason it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفيدة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب علم</span></b> is specified by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد مؤمن</span></b> by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلام عليكم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فإذا رجل قاعد</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span> introduces the unexpected scene. These are different ways for a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> to be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفيدة</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبُ علمٍ حاضرٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص بالإضافة لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقوعها بعد إذا الفجائية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبدٌ مؤمنٌ خيرٌ من مشرك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأخير عن خبر شبه جملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي عام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص بالوصف لفظًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلامٌ عليكم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية إلى معرفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقوعها بعد إذا الفجائية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجت فإذا رجلٌ قاعدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب رجل بإنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقوعها بعد إذا الفجائية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة رجل إلى قاعد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت رجل</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيتِ رجلٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في حرف جر؛ البيت اسم مجرور؛ شبه الجملة خبر مقدّم متعلق بمحذوف تقديره كائن؛ رجل مبتدأ مؤخّر مرفوع</span>. The preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> supplies the setting for the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيتِ: اسم مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيتَ: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيتُ: فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل محذوف لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم، شبه جملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ: مبتدأ مؤخّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٍ: مضاف إليه للبيت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا: حال واجبة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> without full vowel marks.", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ</span></b> the missing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> is understood as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ أحد</span></b>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طائفة</span></b>, the specified account understands <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منهم</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما أحد</span></b> has generality under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أإله</span></b> is introduced by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام. تقدير</span> is a real interpretive distinction from words already expressed.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ يعمل؛ أي كل أحد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة مقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة ملفوظة بعد كل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طائفة قد أهمّتهم أنفسهم؛ أي طائفة منهم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت ملفوظ بين طائفة وقد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصف مقدّر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما أحد في البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص بالإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عموم بعد النفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقوع بعد أمّا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أإله مع الله؟</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة إله إلى مع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct the claim: “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب علم</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبُ علمٍ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مخصوصة بالإضافة إلى نكرة</span>. That <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> can make it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفيدة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> without turning it into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>. Do not confuse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة طالب إلى النكرة علم</span> specifies it but leaves it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب علم</span> cannot ever be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> makes both words <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّم في الفصل</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الفصل معلّم</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمُ في الفصلِ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّم معرفة مبتدأ</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الفصلِ معلّمٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم نكرة مبتدأ مؤخّر</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span> remains internally unchanged.</p>", "group": "5R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> because it follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفصل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الفصل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in both.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّم معرفة مبتدأ مقدّم؛ معلّم نكرة مبتدأ مؤخّر بعد خبر شبه جملة</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يكون المبتدأ نكرة مفيدة</span>.</b> What does <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفيدة</span> require?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفيدة</span></b> concerns the useful meaning supplied by context or construction, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تخصيص، عموم، دعاء</span> or a preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر شبه جملة</span>. It does not mean the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> has secretly become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> in every instance.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المبتدأ</span> whenever it lacks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ال</span>.", "A construction or context making the statement informative.", "A word beginning with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ال</span> in every case."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "Recovering an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">Use a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span></h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف المبتدأ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز</span> when the context supplies it. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من خالدٌ؟: معلّمُنا</span></b> can mean <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو معلّمُنا</span></b>. It also occurs after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الجواب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْ عَمِلَ صَالِحًا فَلِنَفْسِهِ</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعملُه لنفسه</span></b>; and after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قول</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قالوا: أساطيرُ الأوّلين</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، أي</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هي أساطيرُ الأوّلين</span></b>. These contexts permit recovery; they do not make every following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ محذوفًا</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\">Four special constructions</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Construction and selected analysis</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحمدُ للهِ الحميدُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت المقطوع إلى الرفع</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو الحميدُ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ الحميد خبر لمبتدأ محذوف وجوبًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذِمَّتي لأقولنَّ الصدقَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> understood from its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذمّتي عهدٌ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ عهد مبتدأ محذوف وجوبًا</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فصبرٌ جميلٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر ناب عن فعله</span>, analysed as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فصبري صبرٌ جميلٌ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ صبر خبر، وجميل نعت</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نِعْمَ الطالبُ المجتهدُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المخصوص بالمدح</span> analysed as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو المجتهدُ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ هو محذوف وجوبًا</span> on this account</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطع النعت</span></b> means that the description is no longer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابعًا</span> in the original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب: الحميدُ</span> starts an understood <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو الحميدُ</span></b>, unlike the connected <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للهِ الحميدِ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذمّة</span></b> here means a binding pledge or responsibility.</p><p>Two qualifications matter. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فصبرٌ جميلٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> presents patience as settled and enduring, in place of wording such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصبرُ صبرًا جميلًا</span></b>. An account requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف المبتدأ</span> here; another permits expressing it. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المخصوص بالمدح أو الذم</span>, a second recognised account makes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخصوص مبتدأ مؤخّرًا</span> and the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة خبرًا مقدّمًا</span>. Our questions name the selected account rather than treating either alternative as universally wrong.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نِعْمَ الطالبُ المجتهدُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Use the account making <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجتهد خبرًا</span>.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض جامد للمدح، مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجتهد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخصوص بالمدح، خبر مرفوع لمبتدأ محذوف وجوبًا تقديره هو</span>.</li></ul><p>The corresponding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذم</span> pattern is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بِئْسَ الطالبُ الكسولُ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكسول</span></b> = lazy. Keep the original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخصوص</span> distinct.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "Use a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "Four special constructions"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the selected omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> account to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>.", "sol": "<p>The reply <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمنا</span></b> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> to be recovered from the question. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحميدُ</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت المقطوع إلى الرفع, هو</span> is omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوبًا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذمّتي</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم</span> for an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ عهدٌ</span>; the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة القسم</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من خالد؟ معلّمُنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو معلّمنا؛ حذف جائز لقرينة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمنا هو؛ حذف الخبر واجب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا معلّمنا؛ نداء واجب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحمد لله الحميدُ، مع قطع النعت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحميد مجرور لفظًا هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو الحميد؛ حذف واجب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الحميد؛ حذف إنّ واجب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذمّتي لأقولنّ الصدق</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذمتي فاعل لأقولنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصدق مبتدأ محذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذمتي عهدٌ؛ المبتدأ محذوف وجوبًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم الطالب المجتهد</span></b> using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجتهد</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لمبتدأ محذوف</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض جامد للمدح؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجتهد</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخصوص بالمدح وخبر لمبتدأ محذوف وجوبًا تقديره هو</span>. The alternative <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر</span> account is valid but is not the one requested.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض جامد للمدح</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لمبتدأ محذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجتهد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخصوص بالمدح، خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ثان لنعم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ المحذوف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا؛ حذفه ممنوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو؛ حذفه واجب في التحليل المختار</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم؛ فعل محذوف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Recover the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> in the specified accounts.", "sol": "<p>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء الجواب</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعملُه لنفسه</span></b> supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> appropriate to the statement. After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قول</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هي أساطير الأولين</span></b> explains the raised <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أساطير</span>. In the selected <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذم</span> account, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكسول</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو محذوف وجوبًا</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من عمل صالحًا فلنفسه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فنفسُه مفعول به للعمل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا مبتدأ ولا خبر هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعملُه لنفسه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قالوا: أساطيرُ الأولين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هي أساطير الأولين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أساطيرًا مفعول مطلق لقالوا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان أساطيرِ الأولين</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بئس الطالب الكسولُ، والكسول خبر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو الكسولُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الكسولُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا الكسولَ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the precise statement about <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فصبرٌ جميلٌ</span></b>, analysed with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبر</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبرٌ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> in the selected account, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جميلٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت له</span>, with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبري</span> understood. The construction presents enduring patience in place of wording like <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصبر صبرًا جميلًا</span>. Accounts differ on whether <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف المبتدأ</span> is required; do not turn that difference into an absolute <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبرٌ</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا مطلقًا منصوبًا</span> despite its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فصبري صبر جميل؛</span> one account requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> and another permits expressing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جميلٌ</span> is always the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What distinguishes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لله الحميدِ</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحمد لله الحميدُ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطع النعت</span>?", "sol": "<p>In the connected expression <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لله الحميدِ</span></b>, the description follows the earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطع النعت إلى الرفع</span></b>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحميدُ</span></b> belongs to an understood <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو الحميدُ</span></b>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> is omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوبًا</span> in this account.</p>", "group": "6R|Review", "opts": ["The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> turns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحميد</span> into a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.", "Both must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لله</span> precedes them.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحميدِ</span> follows in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر؛ الحميدُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> for an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحذف المبتدأ جوازًا لقرينة، ووجوبًا في مواضع مخصوصة</span>.</b> Which claim respects the distinction?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جوازًا</span></b> allows an expressed or omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span> supports it. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوبًا</span></b> belongs to specified constructions and analytical accounts. The presence of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span> does not by itself establish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوب</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Every omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> is omitted without evidence.", "Every recoverable <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> must be omitted.", "Context can permit <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> without requiring it."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "Recognising the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> and its position", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">What completes the statement?</h2><p>The <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span></b> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المخبَر به</span></b>: what is stated about the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ معلّمٌ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم خبر</span>. Recall <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مفرد، خبر جملة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر شبه جملة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span></b> in this classification means neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>; it does not mean that the word must denote only one person.</p><p>More than one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> can be given: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو الغفورُ الودودُ</span></b>. In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعدّد الخبر</span> analysis, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغفور خبر أول</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الودود خبر ثان</span>. Do not assume that every second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> must be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>.</p><p>The ordinary order is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> then <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم الخبر</span> is possible: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَنا أَعْمَالُنا</span></b>. Position alone does not turn a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span> is not a mechanical rule</h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> containing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ</span> shows the appropriate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مطابقة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبانِ مجتهدانِ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ مجتهدان</span> contains a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبان</span>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الإشارة</span>, compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا طالبٌ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذانِ طالبانِ</span></b>.</p><p>Do not extend this to every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحنُ فتنةٌ</span></b> means “we are a trial.” <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتنة</span> is a single description applied to the group, with no hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> requiring a matching form. It is not an error merely because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span> refers to more than one.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَنا أَعْمَالُنا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Our deeds are ours.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لنا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع خبر مقدّم، متعلّق بمحذوف تقديره كائنة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعمالُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر مرفوع بالضمة، وهو مضاف</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "What completes the statement?"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span> is not a mechanical rule"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. In the final row use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعدّد الخبر</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مفرد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span></b> with hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> forms <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر جملة</span>. In the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعدّد</span> account, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغفور</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الودود</span></b> are two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخبار</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span>. That question does not impose this account on every possible string of descriptions.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد معلّم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد: خبر جملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما حرفان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم: خبر مفرد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ مع فاعله: جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ: اسم مجرور</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو الغفور الودود</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الودود منصوب وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغفور والودود مضاف ومضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغفور خبر أول والودود خبر ثان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لنا أعمالنا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لنا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام حرف جر ونا ضمير مجرور بها؛ شبه الجملة خبر مقدّم متعلق بمحذوف تقديره كائنة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعمالُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر مرفوع ومضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. The two occurrences of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نا</span> have different immediate relationships although both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الابتداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام جزم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نا في لنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر باللام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مقدّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع خبر مقدّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعمال</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر مرفوع، وهو مضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نا في أعمالنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي للام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete with the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مشتق</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبان</span> ...</b>", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبان مجتهدان</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهدان خبر مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى</span>, with a hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبان. مجتهدٌ</span> fails the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مطابقة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهدَين</span> has the wrong <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> for this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهدانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهدَيْنِ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A learner changes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن فتنةٌ</span></b> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span> refers to several people. Choose the correction.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتنةٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد فتنة</span> describes the group as a trial, without the hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> relationship of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مشتق</span> requiring that form of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مطابقة</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> must have precisely the same number form as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>.", "Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتنةٌ</span>: a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span> description can apply to the group without matching its number.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتنة</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the correct roles and endings in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذان طالبان</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذان</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة مبتدأ مرفوع بالألف</span>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبان</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إشارة إلى اثنين</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> show <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة. خبر مفرد</span> in the three-way classification still includes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبان</span> because it is neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>.</p>", "group": "7R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذان فاعل وطالبان مفعول به منصوب بالألف</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذان خبر إنّ وطالبان اسمها</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذان مبتدأ وطالبان خبر؛ كلاهما مرفوع بالألف</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأصل تأخير الخبر، وقد يتقدّم، وقد يتعدّد</span>.</b> Which statement follows?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتقدّم</span></b> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديم الخبر</span>, as in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لنا أعمالنا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتعدّد</span></b> permits more than one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, as in the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغفور والودود</span> analysis. Neither role is assigned solely by position.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> can precede its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>, and one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> can have more than one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.", "The first written expression must always be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>.", "A second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> must always be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضافًا إليه</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "Recovering an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">Required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> in specified patterns</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Pattern</th><th>Example and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> indicates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَعَمْرُكَ لأقولنَّ الصدقَ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ لعمرك قسمي</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span> followed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> with an understood general existence meaning</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا خالدٌ لَرَجَعْنا</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ لولا خالدٌ موجودٌ لرجعنا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف</span> joined by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> explicitly conveying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معية</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلُّ رجلٍ وضَيْعَتُهُ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ كلُّ رجلٍ وضَيْعَتُهُ مقرونانِ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>In the first, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسمي</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر محذوف وجوبًا</span>. In the second, the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> of general existence: do not extend it to every possible meaning after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span>. In the third, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضيعته</span></b> means his occupation or livelihood here; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقرونان</span></b> means joined together. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> already makes the companionship clear, so this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف وجوبًا</span>. An ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> joining two names does not trigger this rule.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\">Keep alternative accounts separate</h2><p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فإنّكم وما تعبدون</span></b> in connected <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> relationship can be analysed in different ways: as conveying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span> serving as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>; as introducing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه</span> with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> supplied later by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما أنتم عليه بفاتنين</span></b>; or as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> with an understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقرونان</span></b>. For our simple <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلُّ رجلٍ وضيعته</span></b> exercises, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العطف مع واو صريحة في المعية وخبر محذوف</span></b>. Do not mix a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول معه منصوب</span> into that selected account.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\">Permitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> with context</h2><p>In a reply <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن حاضرٌ؟: خالدٌ</span></b>, analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and supply <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرٌ</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر محذوف جوازًا</span>. After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجتُ فإذا الأسدُ</span></b> can be expanded with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجودٌ</span></b>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجتُ فإذا أسدٌ واقفٌ</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> is expressed.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا خَالِدٌ لَرَجَعْنا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Were it not for Khalid, we would have returned.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف امتناع لوجود</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع؛ خبره محذوف وجوبًا تقديره موجود</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واقعة في جواب لولا</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجعنا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بنا؛ نا ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li></ul><p>The missing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> completes the relationship after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا. رجعنا</span> gives the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>; it does not replace that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "Required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> in specified patterns"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "Keep alternative accounts separate"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "Permitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> with context"}, {"id": "L8-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> in each selected pattern.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعمرك</span></b> implies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسمي</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>; the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> shows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>. After <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span></b>, the stated general existence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر موجود</span> is omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوبًا</span>. With the specified <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو المعية والعطف</span></b>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقرونان</span></b> is omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوبًا</span> because the connection is already conveyed.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعمرك لأقولنّ الصدق</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسمي؛ محذوف وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصدق؛ مفعول به محذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عهدٌ؛ مبتدأ محذوف هنا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا خالد لرجعنا، مع معنى الوجود العام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد؛ محذوف جوازًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لرجعنا؛ خبر مفرد ملفوظ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجود؛ محذوف وجوبًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل رجل وضيعته، والواو صريحة في المعية مع العطف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقرونان؛ محذوف وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل؛ خبر منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضيعته؛ مفعول معه منصوب في التحليل المختار</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا خالدٌ لرجعنا</span></b> with an understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> of general existence.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف امتناع لوجود؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ وخبره موجود محذوف وجوبًا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في جواب لولا؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجعنا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون ونا فاعل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف امتناع لوجود</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لرجعنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لولا منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع؛ الخبر موجود محذوف وجوبًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام في لرجعنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الابتداء الداخلة على خالد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واقعة في جواب لولا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجعنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض بلا فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ وخبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض ونا فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Supply only the missing element. Use the stated accounts.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span></b> answers the question with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرٌ</span></b> understood as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فإذا الأسدُ</span></b> allows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجود</span> to be supplied. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فإذا أسدٌ واقفٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واقف</span> is already the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>; do not invent another required omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من حاضر؟ خالد؛ خالد مبتدأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ: عامل محذوف وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو: مبتدأ محذوف وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضر: خبر محذوف جوازًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجت فإذا الأسد؛ الأسد مبتدأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرج: خبر محذوف وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجود: خبر محذوف جوازًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسدًا: مفعول به محذوف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجت فإذا أسد واقف؛ واقف خبر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجود محذوف وجوبًا رغم وجود واقف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخبر ملفوظ؛ لا حاجة إلى تقدير خبر محذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ محذوفة وجوبًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد وسعيد حاضران</span></b> require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الخبر</span> merely because it contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ،</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف عليه،</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضران</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالألف</span>. The special <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> pattern requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> conveying the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معية</span> relationship, not every ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["No<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> it has ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> and an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر حاضران</span>.", "Yes<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ حاضران</span> must instead be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا معه منصوبًا</span>.", "Yes<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الخبر</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذمتي لأقولنّ الصدق</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعمرك لأقولنّ الصدق</span></b> using the accounts taught.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذمّتي عهدٌ</span></b> has an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعمرك قسمي</span></b> has an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span> meaning alone does not identify which role is missing; inspect the expressed structure.</p>", "group": "8R|Review", "opts": ["The first omits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ عهدٌ؛</span> the second omits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر قسمي</span>.", "Both omit the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.", "The first omits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> and the second omits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ عمر</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحذف الخبر وجوبًا بعد لولا إذا دلّ على وجود عام</span>.</b> Which limitation must be retained?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا دلّ على وجود عام</span></b> restricts the rule taught. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا خالد لرجعنا</span></b>, the understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجود</span> fits it; do not erase the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> and claim that every conceivable <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> is covered.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Every possible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span> has exactly this meaning.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> that makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد منصوبًا</span>.", "The specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> conveys general existence."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "Linking the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">Recognise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الشرط</span></h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> can imply a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>: anyone or anything meeting its description receives the stated outcome. This can license <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء في الخبر</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> connects the outcome; it does not by itself cause <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد أمّا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا خالدٌ فمجتهدٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span> with the appropriate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الشرط</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي يجتهدُ فله أجرٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصوف بموصول</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ الذي يجتهدُ فله أجرٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة موصوفة بفعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبٌ يجتهدُ فله أجرٌ؛ طالبٌ في الفصلِ فله كتابٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى نكرة موصوفة بفعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمُّ يتيمٍ يتعلّمُ فلها عونٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ مضافة إلى نكرة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلُّ يتيمٍ فله في قلبي رأفةٌ</span></b></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Here <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عون</span></b> = help; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأفة</span></b> = compassion. In the fifth row, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتعلّم</span> describes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتيم</span>: the rule concerns a mother whose orphaned child learns. Read the examples as general <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> for the stated outcome, not arbitrary statements about one already identified person. Do not add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> mechanically after every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا</span></b>, retain its linking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> in these ordinary complete constructions.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا خَالِدٌ فَمُجْتَهِدٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">As for Khalid, he is diligent.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط وتفصيل وتوكيد</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة لجواب أمّا</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</li></ul><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي يجتهدُ فله أجرٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ؛ يجتهد</span> with its hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> forms <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة الموصول؛ الفاء</span> links the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. Inside <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">له أجرٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">له خبر مقدّم</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجر مبتدأ مؤخّر</span>; the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر الذي</span>. Keep the outer and inner relationships separate.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "Recognise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الشرط</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> construction to its pattern.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا</span></b> has its linking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span> with the intended general <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الشرط</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب يجتهد</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة موصوفة بفعل</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل يتيم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل مضافة إلى نكرة</span>. These <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> explain the link; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> alone does not govern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا خالد فمجتهد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء جازمة لمجتهد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء جواب أمّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي يجتهد فله أجر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي حرف نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ موصول متضمّن معنى الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يوجد مبتدأ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب يجتهد فله أجر، مع المعنى العام المشروط</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة باللام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة موصوفة بفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم بالمصدر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل يتيم فله في قلبي رأفة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق مقدّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا لنفي الجنس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل مضافة إلى نكرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا خالد فمجتهد</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط وتفصيل وتوكيد؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة لجواب أمّا؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> connects the statement without changing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> to a different role.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض ناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط وتفصيل وتوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم أمّا منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل نصب في مجتهد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة لجواب أمّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لأمّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read each example with its stated general <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الشرط</span>. Identify the structure allowing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>.", "sol": "<p>The first has <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span></b> described by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي يجتهد</span></b>. In the second, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الفصل</span></b> describes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span> before the linked outcome. In the third, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتيمٍ</span></b> described by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتعلّم</span></b>. Read each in the general <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الشرط</span> stipulated, not as a licence for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> after every ordinary specific <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب الذي يجتهد فله أجر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مضاف إلى معرفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ موصوف بموصول صلته فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا موصول في الكلام</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب في الفصل فله كتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة موصوفة بظرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجهول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير موصوفة بلا قرينة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّ يتيم يتعلّم فلها عون، ويتعلّم وصف ليتيم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتيم خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّ مفعول به مقدّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى نكرة موصوفة بفعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي يجتهد فله أجر</span></b>. Distinguish the outer and inner relationships.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجتهد</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع وفاعله المستتر هو، والجملة صلة الموصول لا محل لها. الفاء تربط الخبر</span>. Within <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">له أجرٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">له خبر مقدّم وأجر مبتدأ مؤخّر؛</span> the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر الذي</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مؤخّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجتهد مع فاعله المستتر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة الموصول لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">له داخل له أجر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجر داخل له أجر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه للهاء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">له أجر كاملة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة ثانية لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر الذي، مرتبطة بالفاء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي يجتهدُ فله أجرٌ</span></b> makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجتهد مجزومًا</span>.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجتهدُ</span></b> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارعًا مرفوعًا لخلوّه من ناصب وجازم</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> links the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> in the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الشرط</span>; it is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> and does not reach back to change the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> ending.</p>", "group": "9R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجتهد مرفوع؛</span> this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> links the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> and is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span>.", "Correct<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> makes every earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزومًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجتهد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> because it precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">له</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يتضمّن المبتدأ معنى الشرط فيصحّ دخول الفاء في خبره</span>.</b> What does <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فيصحّ</span> mean here?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فيصحّ</span></b> states permissibility under the specified meaning and construction. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يتضمّن</span></b> does not say that every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الشرط</span>. Retain the actual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الشرط</span> permits the linking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> always requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> makes every following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منصوبًا</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "10", "title": "Completing the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعات</span> with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نواسخ</span>", "short": "Lesson 10", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s1\">Four remaining roles</h2><p>The same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> ending may belong to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, depending on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المرفوع</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الناقصة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كانَ خالدٌ حاضرًا</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحروف المشبهة بليس</span>, when acting</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما هذا بَشَرًا</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحروف المشبهة بالفعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا حاضرٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا لنفي الجنس</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عملَ مُراءٍ مقبولٌ</span></b></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Recall that these <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوامل</span> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>; their mere appearance does not license ignoring those <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>. In the last example <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مراءٍ</span></b> means someone showing off: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا منصوب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف؛ مراء مضاف إليه؛ مقبول خبر لا مرفوع</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا رجلَ في البيتِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل اسم لا مبني على الفتح في محل نصب؛ في البيت خبرها. اسم لا المضاف</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> in the same way as the non-added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span>.</p><p>Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا المشبهة بليس</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مرفوع وخبر منصوب</span> when it works, from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا لنفي الجنس</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم في محل نصب أو منصوب وخبر مرفوع</span>. For example, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا شيءٌ مشابهًا للهِ</span></b> uses the former <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا شكَّ في ذلك</span></b> uses the latter.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام المزحلقة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th>Where the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> appears</th><th>What remains true</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا لَصادقٌ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا اسم إنّ منصوب؛ صادق خبرها مرفوع</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ في ذلك لَعِبْرَةً</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبرةً اسم إنّ مؤخّر منصوب؛ في ذلك خبرها المقدّم</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ هذا لَهُوَ الحقُّ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا اسم إنّ؛ هو ضمير فصل لا محل له؛ الحق خبرها</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مزحلقة</span></b> describes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> displaced from its earlier position. It adds <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>; it does not cancel <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> or make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبرةً مرفوعة</span>. In the third row, use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير الفصل</span> account; do not insert a new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> into that analysis.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s3\">Recognise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا</span>, including <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span></h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا لنفي الجنس</span> is often <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا شكَّ في ذلك</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> with a general existence meaning is also frequently omitted when understood: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ضَيْرَ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، أي</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ضيرَ موجودٌ عليكم</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضير</span></b> = harm. This <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> is common, not compulsory merely because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> appears.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنَّ في ذلكَ لَعِبْرَةً</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">In that there certainly is a lesson.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبّه بالفعل ينصب الاسم ويرفع الخبر</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذلك</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة في محل جر</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذلك</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة في محل رفع خبر إنّ مقدّم، متعلّق بمحذوف</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام المزحلقة للتوكيد</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبرةً</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ مؤخّر منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L10-s1", "title": "Four remaining roles"}, {"id": "L10-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام المزحلقة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s3", "title": "Recognise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا</span>, including <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "10G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> to its role.", "sol": "<p>The four remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعات</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الأفعال الناقصة، اسم الحروف المشبهة بليس، خبر الحروف المشبهة بالفعل، خبر لا لنفي الجنس</span></b>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما هذا بشرًا, هذا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني في محل رفع اسم ما</span>; it does not acquire a visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان خالدٌ حاضرًا: خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل ناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما هذا بشرًا: هذا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ما المشبهة بليس في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا حاضرٌ: حاضر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر حرف مشبّه بالفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل إنّ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عملَ مراءٍ مقبولٌ: مقبول</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا لنفي الجنس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "10G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ في ذلك لعبرةً</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنصب الاسم وترفع الخبر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر و</span><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذلك</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة في محل جر؛ شبه الجملة في محل رفع خبر إنّ مقدّم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مزحلقة للتوكيد؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبرةً</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ مؤخّر منصوب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> does not cancel the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف يرفع الاسم وينصب الخبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف ينصب الاسم ويرفع الخبر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذلك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة في محل جر بفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ في محل نصب هنا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذلك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مقدّم في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب لفظًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام المزحلقة للتوكيد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبرة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مجرور باللام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ مؤخّر منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مرفوع بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "10I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the endings with the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> explicitly stated.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا شيءٌ مشابهًا لله</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل ليس: اسم مرفوع وخبر منصوب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عملَ مراءٍ مقبولٌ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا لنفي الجنس: اسمها المضاف منصوب وخبرها مرفوع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا لصادقٌ</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوبًا وخبرها مرفوعًا</span> despite <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام المزحلقة</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا المشبهة بليس: لا شيء... مشابه... لله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شيءٌ مشابهًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شيءَ مشابهٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شيءٍ مشابهٍ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا لنفي الجنس: لا عمل... مراء... مقبول</span>...", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عملٍ مراءٌ مقبولٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عملَ مراءٍ مقبولٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عملُ مراءً مقبولًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ: إنّ خالد... لصادق</span>...", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا لصادقٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ لصادقٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ لصادقًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "10I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ هذا لهو الحقّ. لا شكّ في ذلك. لا ضير</span></b>. Use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فصل</span> and supply a general existence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ضير</span>.", "sol": "<p>In the specified account <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فصل لا محل له</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحقُّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شكَّ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا مبني على الفتح في محل نصب</span>, with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذلك</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ضيرَ</span></b> has a contextually understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجود عليكم</span>; such <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> is common, not a blanket requirement after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ ثان منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ الوحيد في هذا التحليل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فصل لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحقّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لهو</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شكّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا مبني على الفتح في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ذلك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا شبه جملة في محل رفع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا ضير</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضير نفسه خبر لا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف مفهوم؛ تقديره موجود عليكم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف وجوبًا في كل تركيب مع لا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "10R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا رجلَ في البيت</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ علمٍ في البيت</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلَ</span></b> is the non-added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا: مبني على الفتح في محل نصب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> and therefore <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا منصوب بالفتحة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span></b> supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا</span> in both.</p>", "group": "10R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مبني على الفتح في محل نصب؛ طالب اسم لا منصوب لأنه مضاف، وعلم مضاف إليه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم مفعول به للا، وطالب مبني على الكسر</span>.", "Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الأفعال الناقصة مرفوع، وخبر الحروف المشبهة بالفعل مرفوع</span>.</b> Apply this to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان حامدٌ صادقًا. إنّ حامدًا صادقٌ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان</span></b> raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها حامدٌ</span> and assigns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها صادقًا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b> assigns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها حامدًا</span> and raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها صادقٌ</span>. Name the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> before assigning the role.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامد خبر كان وصادق اسم إنّ</span>.", "Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوامل</span> raise their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> and put their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامد اسم كان مرفوع؛ صادق خبر إنّ مرفوع</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review: Establish the role before the ending", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Work through the passages before choosing. For each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>, name its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and role; for each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف</span>, identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span> and whether <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span> in the specified account.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify all eight <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعات</span> from their relationships.", "sol": "<p>The roles in order are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل، نائب فاعل، مبتدأ، خبر، اسم فعل ناقص، اسم حرف مشبّه بليس، خبر حرف مشبّه بالفعل، خبر لا لنفي الجنس</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع</span> because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>. The others identified here show <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع لفظًا</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinctions", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل المسافرُ: المسافر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتح البابُ: الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافرُ متعبٌ: المسافر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافر متعبٌ: متعب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان المسافرُ متعبًا: المسافر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل ناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما هذا بشرًا: هذا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم حرف مشبّه بليس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ المسافر متعبٌ: متعب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر حرف مشبّه بالفعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا عملَ مراءٍ مقبولٌ: مقبول</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا لنفي الجنس</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which account correctly distinguishes the missing roles in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمنا</span></b> as a reply to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من خالد؟</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b> as a reply to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من حاضر؟</span> Assume the expressed word is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> in the first and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> in the second.", "sol": "<p>The first retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمنا</span></b> and recovers <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span></b>. The second retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b> and recovers <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضر</span></b>. Both rely on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة السؤال</span> and permit the omitted expression to be stated.</p>", "group": "A|Distinctions", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو معلّمنا: مبتدأ محذوف؛ خالد حاضر: خبر محذوف</span>. Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> cases are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز</span> with context.", "Both omit a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل وجوبًا</span>.", "Both omit <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> because no written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> appears."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the correct endings and relationships.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُلّم الكتابُ</span></b> raises <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ في الصبر لعبرةً</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب اسم إنّ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام المزحلقة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم سعيدًا أخوه</span></b> puts <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span> containing the referring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span>. In the selected <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل رجل وضيعته</span></b> account, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضيعتُه معطوف مرفوع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقرونان خبر محذوف وجوبًا</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُلّم الكتاب...؛ الفعل مجهول</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابُ: نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ: مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ في الصبر لعبر...؛</span> use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبرة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعبرةً: اسم إنّ مؤخّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعبرةٌ: مبتدأ تلغيه إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعبرةٍ: مجرور بلام الجر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم سعيد... أخو...؛ الهاء تعود إلى سعيد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ أخيهِ؛ كلاهما مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا أخوهُ؛ مفعول به ثم فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ أخاهُ؛ مع بقاء سعيد مفعولًا به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل رجل وضيعته؛ عطف مع واو صريحة في المعية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضَيْعَتُهُ معطوف مرفوع؛ الخبر مقرونان محذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضَيْعَتَهُ مفعول معه مع إبقاء تحليل العطف نفسه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضَيْعَتِهِ مجرور بالواو</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the only accurate correction of these claims: “Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>; every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> must follow it; every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الخبر</span>.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت رجلٌ</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مبتدأ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد وسعيد حاضران</span></b> has an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> and an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. Each original claim incorrectly removes an important <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> or permitted variation.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["Only the first claim needs correction; the other two are always true.", "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مفيدة</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> can precede it; the special <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> rule requires the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى المعية</span>.", "All three are true without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اقرأ</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجت فإذا رجل واقف. أكرمه حامد. فُتح الباب. أمّا الرجل فمتعب</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التركيب المناسب</span>. In the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>, take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واقف</span> as the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجتُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فجائية؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ نكرة مفيدة بهذا السياق و</span><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واقفٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ملفوظ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمَه حامدٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء مفعول به متصل، وحامد فاعل مؤخّر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُتح البابُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مجهول ونائب فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا الرجلُ فمتعبٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّا حرف شرط وتفصيل وتوكيد؛ الرجل مبتدأ؛ الفاء رابطة؛ متعب خبر</span>. The recurring word <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span> keeps its reference while its relationships change.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء في خرجتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث بلا محل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الشرطية للمستقبل هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل واقف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل فاعل وواقف مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مبتدأ وواقف خبر؛ النكرة بعد إذا الفجائية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل اسم إنّ وواقف خبرها</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء في أكرمه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به متصل يعود إلى رجل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل متصل يعود إلى حامد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لفعل أكرم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مؤخّر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مؤخّر عن أكرم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل مرفوع لفُتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كان محذوفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لفعل معلوم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل بعد أمّا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم أمّا منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فمتعب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء جازمة؛ متعب فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء رابطة؛ متعب خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء حرف جر؛ متعب مجرور</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التركيب الكامل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ في البيت لطالبَ علمٍ. كان الطالبُ مجتهدًا</span>.</b>", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف ينصب الاسم ويرفع الخبر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيتِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلق بمحذوف في محل رفع خبر إنّ مقدّم؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مزحلقة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ مؤخّر منصوب ومضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض ناقص؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها مرفوع؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهدًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها منصوب. اللام المزحلقة</span> does not remove the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبّه بالفعل ينصب الاسم ويرفع الخبر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت اسم إنّ منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في حرف جر والبيت مجرور؛ شبه الجملة خبر إنّ مقدّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة فاعل لإنّ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مزحلقة للتوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ مؤخّر منصوب، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض ناقص مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبّه بالفعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل كان التامة في هذه الجملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كان مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ مرفوع بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كان منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صل العبارة بتطبيقها الصحيح</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الدار ضيفٌ</span></b> licenses the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مقدّم</span>. In the specified accounts, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامد</span></b> completes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, while <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخبر</span></b> completes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكتوب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا حامد لخرجنا</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر موجود محذوف وجوبًا</span> under the stated general existence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مفيدة بتقديم الخبر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الضيفُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ ضيفًا حاضرٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الدار ضيفٌ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مكتفٍ بمرفوعه؛ اختر هذا التحليل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقائمٌ حامدٌ؟ قائم مبتدأ وحامد فاعل سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ حامدًا قائم؛ قائم اسم إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامد قائم؛ حامد مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر محذوف وجوبًا لدلالته على وجود عام بعد لولا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حامد موجود؛ الخبر محذوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا حامد لخرجنا؛ التقدير حامد موجود</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرج حامد؛ حامد خبر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل لاسم مفعول عامل؛ اختر المكتفي بمرفوعه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخبر مكتوب؛ الخبر مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتب حامد الخبر؛ الخبر نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمكتوبٌ الخبرُ؟ الخبر نائب فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "D2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يلزم من الجرّ في اللفظ انتفاء الفاعلية، ولا من الرفع اتّحاد الموقع الإعرابي</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التطبيق الصحيح</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتفاء الفاعلية</span></b> means absence of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> relationship; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اتّحاد الموقع</span></b> means having the same role. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشيرٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> despite visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الزائدة. خالدٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span> but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كان</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان</span>; shared <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> does not make the roles identical.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل مجرور لفظًا مضاف إليه، وكل مبتدأ مرفوع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر خالد وكان خالد حاضرًا لهما التركيب نفسه في جميع الكلمات</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشيرٍ في ما جاء من بشيرٍ فاعل؛ خالدٌ في حضر خالد وكان خالد حاضرًا مرفوع مع اختلاف الموقع</span>."], "ans": 2}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>For each expression, establish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العامل، المعمول، العلاقة، الإعراب والدليل</span></b>. Explain unusual word order, identify a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span> before supplying a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف</span>, and keep alternative accounts separate. Revisit any rule whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> you cannot explain even after selecting the right answer.</p>"}], "revisit": "<ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل، نائب فاعل</span> and word order: Lessons 1–3.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مفيدة</span>: Lessons 4–5.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف المبتدأ والخبر</span> and alternative accounts: Lessons 6 and 8.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر، مطابقة</span> and linking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>: Lessons 7 and 9.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نواسخ، لا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام المزحلقة</span>: Lesson 10.</li></ul>"};
